  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AU Charter on the Rights and Welfare of the Child - Plan /Save the Children Swden Promoting ACRWC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AU Charter on the Rights and Welfare of the Child</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This support is related to a proposal submitted by Plan Sweden,       together with Save the Children Sweden and coalition of NGOs active   in Africa. The main objective of the support is to improve the lives  of children in Africa as per the provisions of ACRWC by enhancing the capacity of AU Organs, AU Committee of Experts on ACRWC and of CSOs   to engage with the AUC and its organs on child rights issues.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">This support is related to a proposal submitted by Plan Sweden,       together with Save the Children Sweden and coalition of NGOs active   in Africa. The main objective of the support is to improve the lives  of children in Africa as per the provisions of ACRWC by enhancing the capacity of AU Organs, AU Committee of Experts on ACRWC and of CSOs   to engage with the AUC and its organs on child rights issues.</narrative>
  </description>
